<p rendition="#et2">1. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Fragilis</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">die Blindschleiche, Bruch-<lb/>
schlange, der Haselwurm, Hartwurm</hi>.<lb/>
(<hi rendition="#g">Fr</hi>. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">l&#x2019;orvet</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">Engl</hi>. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">the blind-worm, slow-worm</hi></hi>.)<lb/>
