<p rendition="#et2">1. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Persuasorius</hi></hi>. (<hi rendition="#aq">Pimpla</hi> <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">persuasoria</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#aq">F</hi>.) <hi rendition="#aq">I.<lb/>
scutello albo, thorace maculato, abdomine<lb/>
atro segmentis omnibus vtrinqne punctis duo-<lb/>
